DESCRIPTION:Digital Governance Standards Institute\n60-day public review of
  a proposed National Standard of Canada setting governance\, transparency\
 , human-oversight and lifecycle-monitoring requirements for AI clinical de
 cision support.\nWhy it matters: Sets concrete human-oversight and post-de
 ployment monitoring duties for high-stakes AI\, a template regulators beyo
 nd health are likely to reference.\nHow to participate: Download the draft
  and submit comments through the DGSI public review form before 5 October 
 2026.\nhttps://dgc-cgn.org/product/patient-visible-and-accountable-ai-in-c
 linical-decision-support/\nTracked by AI Consultation Deadlines Canada: ht
 tps://donjguido.github.io/ai-consultation-deadlines-canada
